# Hovering someone who stands in front of a landmark names them, not the landmark behind (V7-022):
# what is picked is what is drawn under the pointer, nearest first, for the hover as for the
# click. The Forum's paving is itself a landmark with a card.
set chatter quiet
set season spring
set day 1
set time 0.2
set weather clear
set world forum 2
wait 90
move life:rome.citizen
wait 6
expect tip Citizen
move life:rome.senator
wait 6
expect tip Senator
